  "insights": [
   "RBC marked Q4 2026 Henry Hub to $3.15/MMBtu, lowered 2027 to $3.45/MMBtu and launched 2028 at $3.83/MMBtu. The path is a grind higher driven by demand-pull from LNG exports and power burn.",
