  "insights": [
   "GS reported 4QFY26 (Sept) revenue of $778 mn (+26% yoy, +8% qoq) and adjusted EBITDA of $114 mn, vs Street (FactSet) $774 mn / $104 mn. Revenue was near the top of the $760-780 mn guidance range.",
