  "insights": [
   "UBS CIO sees Europe entering a phase of renewal, with earnings growth set to accelerate on fiscal expansion, policy reforms and structural drivers (AI, power and resources, longevity). It recommends a diversified approach across sectors.",
   "The CIO Equity Selection List has 25 European names across five themes: Demographics and Consumers, Defence and Infrastructure, Financing structural reforms, Industry 4.0 and Automation, and Decarbonization. Benchmark is MSCI EMU.",
